# Credentials for gated ingest sources. Copy to .env (gitignored) and fill in what you want.
# Nothing here is needed to build the site — only to make gated sources live.

# X / Twitter — @realDonaldTrump (the ranked #1 source)
# Create an app at https://developer.x.com, then use its App-only Bearer Token.
# Note: X's free tier cannot read another account's posts; reading his timeline needs the
# paid Basic tier. Until this is set, `node tools/ingest.mjs` reports the source as skipped.
X_BEARER_TOKEN=

# Reddit — meme subs. A free "script" app: https://www.reddit.com/prefs/apps
# Used instead of the anonymous .rss feeds because reddit.com/robots.txt disallows crawlers.
REDDIT_CLIENT_ID=
REDDIT_CLIENT_SECRET=